# Input
```yaml
# should generate diagnostics
name: CI
on: push
jobs:
  build:
    name: Build
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
      - name:
        run: echo "empty"
      - name: "  "
        run: echo "blank"

```

# Diagnostics
```
ci.yaml:9:9 lint/nursery/useGithubWorkflowStepName ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

  ! This step doesn't have a name.
  
     7 │     runs-on: ubuntu-latest
     8 │     steps:
   > 9 │       - name:
       │         ^^^^
    10 │         run: echo "empty"
    11 │       - name: "  "
  
  i Without a name, GitHub shows the action or the command of the step in the job log, which makes it harder to see what the step is for.
  
  i Add a name key to the step that describes what it does.
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

```

